From b79e48a063d164f500dc34c2faf46cb463a58d8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Jhong <dylan@andestech.com>
Date: Tue, 3 May 2022 13:56:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 004/241] atcdmac300: Support atcdmac300 on AE350.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Jhong <dylan@andestech.com>
